# Build context of all four images (docker/liturgos-auditor-stt and docker/liturgos-auditor-train).
# Allow-list: everything is excluded unless it is named below, so nothing unexpected can ever
# enter a build context or be picked up by a careless `COPY . .`. This directory holds local
# virtualenvs (1.8 GB and more), test fixtures and can end up holding data/, models/, ledger.sqlite
# or voice recordings when someone runs the CLI from here; none of that belongs in an image.
*

# The only files the Dockerfiles COPY. If a Dockerfile starts to COPY something else, add it here.
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!auditor_stt/

# Re-exclude bytecode inside the allowed directory: local .pyc files are for another Python
# version or platform than the image's, and only make the layer larger and less reproducible.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
